{"id":322,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为加强我院研究生之间交流和互动，丰富我院研究生的课余生活，进一步增进同学们之间的友谊，4月8日8:00在羽毛球馆，我院举行第五届研究生羽毛球赛，50余名研究生报名参加此次比赛。</p><p>为了增加同学们参加的积极性以及比赛的趣味性，本次比赛分为单打、双打和趣味活动三个项目。通过抽签决定比赛对手和出场顺序，采用小组循环和淘汰赛制，最终决出各项目的获奖者，并颁发精美的获奖礼品和参赛礼品。比赛在热烈的气氛中圆满结束，部分参赛选手、工作人员以及老师合影留念。</p><p>本次羽毛球比赛为我院研究生创造了交流和认识的机会，增进了同学们之间的感情，更通过比赛展现出我院学生积极向上、努力拼搏、不断进取的精神风貌，祝愿同学们可以在未来的研究生学习中更好地完成各项科研任务。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YLNW47MzlsMmAkn8ln7UNnRM7L4nzni7UmNDL4GYL7-8UzU0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysLYh2n1ybnzARU4-PLzlPoz67MR6kLmnkL8WkLzUbnmWFUm78MlCPLNVFnNUaMmvJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzL8Mm-JqdDnx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=13462&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/673FF9E8CC2115197D47B24B3BB149F2/B145F12A/FD067\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YLNW47MzlsMmAkn8ln7UNnRM7L4nzni7UmNDL4GYL7-8UzU0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysLYh2n1ybnzARU4-PLzlPoz67MR6kLmnkL8WkLzUbnmWFUm78MlCPLNVFnNUaMmvJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzL8Mm-JqdDnx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=13462&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YnlV4kLmWVnm7DM87LaM7CPoR9PUzGiDo7WkMN7aM4Ganml0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yaLkyYnkyDoRvDU8lanNWfM4n7oznkoz7an7liU4-sMmfFnzNbU4VRLNVFLlr7MmCJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzL8Mm-JqdDnx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=13462&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6002D6876CE0FBA74D94B910DE5C2760/E99C1C2A/1ED66\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YUlW4fM8UaLzvPL8zQknln2UNlboR6iVnRlPLz6knzUbM7L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRLSyYnSyZM8nknNlaMRnRLllsUmvioRLDU4U8olQRLmMFMlCaLmrfLRTFLzTkMRNDgjfJQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg474MRCYgtA8pUDcc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=13462&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YU4V4VUzMkL7VkL84-DolrkU8l4L8Vi7nlMfMlCPMzCbLR90gihFp2hmCIa0n1yaL1hfLYy4nR9iLlUYM4LaLRUYMzGZnmn7MzL4MRGaM8rFLRL8Mzl4nzAFLz9sU4vJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzL8Mm-JqdDnx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=13462&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F02A33D851D2730042508F4D5334007E/034553E8/187C7\" vheight=\"\"